---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/retail.css';
---
<Base
  title="Services — Airborne Dent Repair"
  description="Hail damage repair, paintless dent and door ding repair, windshield replacement and XPEL window tint in Gunter, Texas. Free estimates, lifetime warranty on paintless work."
  nav="Services" css="retail">
<main>

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-panel">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">What We Do</p>
    <h1 class="display h-xl rv rv-d1">Four Things.<br>All Of Them Right.</h1>
    <p class="lede rv rv-d2">Paintless dent and hail repair, windshield replacement, and XPEL window tint &mdash; out of one shop in Gunter, Texas. Estimates are free on all four.</p>
    <div class="cta-row rv rv-d2">
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/contact">Get a free estimate <span>&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+16822260543">Call 682-226-0543</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="hero-facts rv rv-d3">
      <li>Free estimates</li><li>Veteran owned</li><li>Gunter, TX &middot; serving DFW</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-figure" style="--hero:url('/img/hero-sclass-on-lift.jpg')">
    <span class="slot-tag hero-slot-tag">Customer vehicle &middot; Airborne Dent Repair</span>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="marquee-track">
    <ul>
      <li>Free Estimates</li>
      <li>Lifetime PDR Warranty</li>
      <li>Master ARC Certified</li>
      <li>Loaner Vehicles Available</li>
      <li>We Work With Your Insurance</li>
      <li>Veteran Owned &amp; Operated</li>
    </ul>
    <ul>
      <li>Free Estimates</li>
      <li>Lifetime PDR Warranty</li>
      <li>Master ARC Certified</li>
      <li>Loaner Vehicles Available</li>
      <li>We Work With Your Insurance</li>
      <li>Veteran Owned &amp; Operated</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<section>
  <div class="wrap sec-head lead">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">The Four</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">Pick The One<br>You Came For.</h2>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="services">
  <a class="svc rv" href="/hail-damage-repair">
    <span class="shot" role="img" aria-label="Hail damage across a black Mercedes-Benz C-Class hood" style="background-image:url('/img/card-hail-damage.jpg')"></span>
    <span class="svc-body">
      <h3>Hail Damage<br>Repair</h3>
      <p>Whole-storm damage or a single dented panel, repaired without touching the factory paint.</p>
      <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
    </span>
  </a>
  <a class="svc rv rv-d1" href="/paintless-dent-repair">
    <span class="shot" role="img" aria-label="A reflection board reading a door panel during paintless dent repair" style="background-image:url('/img/card-dent-ding.jpg')"></span>
    <span class="svc-body">
      <h3>Dent &amp; Door<br>Ding Repair</h3>
      <p>Door dings, creases and transport damage &mdash; no filler, no paint, lifetime warranty.</p>
      <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
    </span>
  </a>
  <a class="svc rv rv-d2" href="/windshield-replacement">
    <span class="slot">
      <span class="slot-tag">Photo needed &mdash; real windshield job</span>
    </span>
    <span class="svc-body">
      <h3>Windshield<br>Replacement</h3>
      <p>Replacement at the shop or mobile at your home or workplace, whichever suits you.</p>
      <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
    </span>
  </a>
  <a class="svc rv rv-d3" href="/window-tint">
    <span class="shot" role="img" aria-label="A tinted pickup in the shop bay" style="background-image:url('/img/card-window-tint.jpg')"></span>
    <span class="svc-body">
      <h3>Window<br>Tint</h3>
      <p>XPEL film exclusively, carrying the manufacturer&rsquo;s warranty.</p>
      <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
    </span>
  </a>
</div>

<section>
  <div class="wrap intro">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">What Carries Across All Four</p>
      <h2 class="display h-md rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 1.25rem;max-width:20ch">One Shop, One Standard.</h2>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2">Every one of these is done in Gunter by a Master ARC certified technician, at a volume the shop chooses rather than one the calendar forces. Paintless work carries a lifetime warranty. Tint carries XPEL&rsquo;s manufacturer warranty. Estimates are free before any of it starts.</p>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2" style="margin-top:1rem">If you are not sure which of the four you need &mdash; and with hail it is often two of them &mdash; send photos or call. We will tell you what you are looking at before anything is booked.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rv rv-d1">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Across Every Service</p>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Estimates</dt><dd>Free</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Paintless dent &amp; hail</dt><dd>Lifetime warranty</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Window tint</dt><dd>XPEL manufacturer&rsquo;s warranty</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Windshields</dt><dd>Mobile or in-shop</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Technician</dt><dd>Master ARC certified</dd></div>
        <div><dt>While it is here</dt><dd>Loaner vehicles available</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap sec-head lead">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Where We Work</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">Gunter Is Home Base.<br>The Work Isn&rsquo;t.</h2>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="steps steps-3">
  <div class="step rv">
    <p class="n">01</p>
    <h3>The shop</h3>
    <p>489 Reed Ln, Unit 2, Gunter. Drop-off, loaner keys, and all four services under one roof.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d1">
    <p class="n">02</p>
    <h3>Greater DFW &amp; North Texas</h3>
    <p>Routine repairs, mobile windshield service, and dealer accounts across the metroplex.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d2">
    <p class="n">03</p>
    <h3>Nationwide, for catastrophe</h3>
    <p>When a severe hail event hits, we send catastrophe response teams to the affected area.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<a class="cross" href="/wholesale">
  <p class="eyebrow">Dealer, body shop or fleet?</p>
  <h2 class="display h-sm">Wholesale &amp; Fleet Accounts</h2>
  <p>Pickup and delivery, up to 25 vehicles a week, and the same lifetime warranty on every
    paintless repair we perform.</p>
  <span class="go">See wholesale <span>&rarr;</span></span>
</a>

<section class="final">
  <div class="wrap final-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Free Estimate &middot; No Obligation</p>
      <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 1.25rem;max-width:16ch">Send Us The Damage.</h2>
      <div class="cta-row rv rv-d2">
        <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/contact">Get a free estimate <span>&rarr;</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+16822260543">Call 682-226-0543</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-block rv rv-d1">
      <strong>Airborne Dent Repair</strong>
      <span>489 Reed Ln, Unit 2</span>
      <span style="margin-bottom:.6rem">Gunter, TX 75058</span>
      <a href="mailto:airbornepdr@gmail.com">airbornepdr@gmail.com</a>
      <a href="tel:+16822260543">682-226-0543</a>
      <span>Fax 833-907-5267</span>
      <span style="margin-top:.6rem">Mon&ndash;Sat 9:00 AM &ndash; 7:00 PM &middot; Closed Sunday</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</main>
</Base>
